Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.44,1:56:36.76,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}胸の奥　温かくて
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.76,1:56:43.94,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}この景色を　喜び合えて
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.94,1:56:47.66,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HFBEDD3&}まだこれからだね
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.66,1:56:51.52,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H5EE4FF&}駆けて行くのにね
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.52,1:56:57.99,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H0061EB&}想い出ばかり　溢れている
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.26,1:57:01.73,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HDA9D00&}長い遠回りを
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.73,1:57:05.82,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6555EA&}受け止めてくれて
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.82,1:57:12.38,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HFBEDD3&\t(2506,2826,\3c&H6D00E6&)}何処まで探しても　世界で
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.38,1:57:17.41,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H5EE4FF&}ここにしかない　未来
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.41,1:57:24.68,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}ずっと　見守ってくれて
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.68,1:57:31.52,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H0061EB&}永遠でも奪えない　宝物に囲まれた
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.52,1:57:39.52,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HFBEDD3&}今が　一番幸せだって
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.52,1:57:43.07,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6555EA&}どんな明日でも言える
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.07,1:57:48.10,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H5EE4FF&}終わりのない夢を
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.73,1:57:53.64,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HDA9D00&}ずっと　ありがとう
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.14,1:57:59.84,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HFBEDD3&}甘えていたよね
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.84,1:58:03.32,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HFBEDD3&}困らせていたよね
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.32,1:58:10.73,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H0061EB&}気付かないうちに　夢が増えていった
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.73,1:58:18.24,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6555EA&}怖いほどの喜びに　戸惑い鑄躇うけれど
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.24,1:58:23.06,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H5EE4FF&}欲張りになってもいいですか？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.06,1:58:29.26,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}これから　ずっともっと誰よりも
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.36,1:58:36.76,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}絶対　胸を張って行くね
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.76,1:58:40.27,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}自慢して欲しいから
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.27,1:58:45.55,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&\t(1733,2053,\3c&HFBEDD3&)}十年後も　何年過ぎても
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.55,1:58:51.91,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HDA9D00&}想い出になる今を
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.93,1:58:58.79,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H5EE4FF&}照れ笑い　一緒に想い出そう
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.79,1:59:06.28,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}星への願いは　変わっていくとしても
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.28,1:59:13.67,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}あの淚　笑顔の全てが
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.00,1:59:28.49,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}ずっと　見守っていてね
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.49,1:59:32.17,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6555EA&}永遠に色褪せない
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.17,1:59:34.99,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HDA9D00&}めぐり逢いを　分け合って　
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.99,1:59:42.86,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}歩いて　生まれ変われるときも
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.86,1:59:46.88,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HFBEDD3&}運命に挫けない
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.88,1:59:51.52,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}光続ける日々と
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.32,1:59:55.20,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}愛をありがとう
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.20,1:59:59.84,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}笑顔のままでいてね
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.84,2:00:02.57,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}時が過ぎても
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.57,2:00:07.25,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}伝えきれない気持ちを
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.25,2:00:10.02,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}届けて行くから（ずっと）
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.02,2:00:14.60,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}笑顔で歩き出そう
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.60,2:00:17.41,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}心にいつも
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.41,2:00:21.66,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}時が過ぎてもいつまでも
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.66,2:00:28.44,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}ずっと　ありがとう
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.09,2:00:49.01,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}ずっと　ありがとう
Dialogue: 1,1:56:29.44,1:56:36.76,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}內心深處泛起暖流
Dialogue: 1,1:56:36.76,1:56:43.94,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}為這份景色共享喜悅
Dialogue: 1,1:56:43.94,1:56:47.66,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HFBEDD3&}征程仍在前方
Dialogue: 1,1:56:47.66,1:56:51.52,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H5EE4FF&}還需砥礪前行
Dialogue: 1,1:56:51.52,1:56:57.99,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H0061EB&}回憶卻止不住地湧出
Dialogue: 1,1:56:58.26,1:57:01.73,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HDA9D00&}這一路漫長而曲折
Dialogue: 1,1:57:01.73,1:57:05.82,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6555EA&}謝謝你的包容理解
Dialogue: 1,1:57:05.82,1:57:12.38,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HFBEDD3&\t(2506,2826,\3c&H6D00E6&)}即使找遍世界每一處角落
Dialogue: 1,1:57:12.38,1:57:17.41,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H5EE4FF&}都只能在此處看到的未來
Dialogue: 1,1:57:17.41,1:57:24.68,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}一直以來　默默守護著我
Dialogue: 1,1:57:24.68,1:57:31.52,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H0061EB&}永遠不會消逝的寶物　圍繞在身邊
Dialogue: 1,1:57:31.52,1:57:39.52,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HFBEDD3&}當下就是最幸福的時刻
Dialogue: 1,1:57:39.52,1:57:43.07,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6555EA&}無論明日如何都能斷言
Dialogue: 1,1:57:43.07,1:57:48.10,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H5EE4FF&}為永不完結的夢想
Dialogue: 1,1:57:48.73,1:57:53.64,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HDA9D00&}永遠　心懷感恩
Dialogue: 1,1:57:56.14,1:57:59.84,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HFBEDD3&}一直以來依賴著你
Dialogue: 1,1:57:59.84,1:58:03.32,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HFBEDD3&}讓你覺得頭疼了吧
Dialogue: 1,1:58:03.32,1:58:10.73,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H0061EB&}不知不覺間　夢想變多了
Dialogue: 1,1:58:10.73,1:58:18.24,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6555EA&}這份幸福過於耀眼　讓我有些迷茫猶豫
Dialogue: 1,1:58:18.24,1:58:23.06,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H5EE4FF&}但我能再貪心一點嗎？
Dialogue: 1,1:58:23.06,1:58:29.26,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}從今以後也永遠　比任何人都
Dialogue: 1,1:58:29.36,1:58:36.76,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}一定會挺起胸膛向前走的
Dialogue: 1,1:58:36.76,1:58:40.27,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}因為想讓你為我驕傲
Dialogue: 1,1:58:40.27,1:58:45.55,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&\t(1733,2053,\3c&HFBEDD3&)}不管十年　還是多少年後
Dialogue: 1,1:58:45.55,1:58:51.91,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HDA9D00&}當此刻成為記憶
Dialogue: 1,1:58:52.93,1:58:58.79,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H5EE4FF&}再帶著害羞的笑　一起回憶吧
Dialogue: 1,1:58:58.79,1:59:06.28,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}即使向星星許下的願望改變
Dialogue: 1,1:59:06.28,1:59:13.67,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}那份淚水與笑容的一切都不會消失
Dialogue: 1,1:59:21.00,1:59:28.49,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}一直以來　默默守護著我
Dialogue: 1,1:59:28.49,1:59:32.17,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6555EA&}這份永不褪色
Dialogue: 1,1:59:32.17,1:59:34.99,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HDA9D00&}獨一無二的邂逅　由我們共享
Dialogue: 1,1:59:34.99,1:59:42.86,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}並肩而行　一起迎來新生
Dialogue: 1,1:59:42.86,1:59:46.88,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&HFBEDD3&}不向命運低頭
Dialogue: 1,1:59:46.88,1:59:51.52,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}為光芒不斷的每日
Dialogue: 1,1:59:52.32,1:59:55.20,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}為愛感恩
Dialogue: 1,1:59:55.20,1:59:59.84,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}要保持笑容啊
Dialogue: 1,1:59:59.84,2:00:02.57,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}即使歲月變遷
Dialogue: 1,2:00:02.57,2:00:07.25,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}這份道不完的心情
Dialogue: 1,2:00:07.25,2:00:10.02,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}我會一直向你傳達（直到永遠）
Dialogue: 1,2:00:10.02,2:00:14.60,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}帶著笑容出發吧
Dialogue: 1,2:00:14.60,2:00:17.41,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}心裡總是
Dialogue: 1,2:00:17.41,2:00:21.66,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H6D00E6&}即使歲月變遷　直到永遠
Dialogue: 1,2:00:21.66,2:00:28.44,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}永遠　感謝著你
Dialogue: 1,2:00:41.09,2:00:49.01,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,320)\blur3\3c&H9A6DEB&}永遠　感謝著你
